# Tangle Kelp taps its enchanted creature, which untaps if it did not attack on its last turn, stays tapped after attacking, then untaps after a turn without attacking (CR 502.3).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Tangle Kelp
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Tangle Kelp.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Hand.Tangle Kelp.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter)
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
[T8 Bot2.Main1]

